{"id":920044,"title":"结课测试｜检验一下学习成果吧！","content":"<p>课程内容告一段落，非常感谢你一直以来的认真学习和支持！</p><p>为了帮你检验学习效果，我特意给你准备了一套结课测试题。这套测试题共 20 道题目，10 道单选题，10道多选题，作答时间30分钟。考点都来自我们前面讲到的重要知识。点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=9202&exam_id=20596\"><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/28/a4/28d1be62669b4f3cc01c36466bf811a4.png?wh=1142*201\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>最后，我还给你准备了一份<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/djkCnv\">结课问卷</a>，希望你能花几分钟填写一下，非常期待能听到你对这门课的反馈。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403367,"user_name":"夏落de烦恼","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1875724,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"0CBDC51EF566A6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/9f/0c/8484f8b1.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1763200746,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146556,"content":"三场直播也是必学内容已经看完了吗","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1763351376,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":403367,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"全部都学完了进度在96% 到不了100%咋办","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":674137,"discussion_content":"三场直播也是必学内容已经看完了吗","content_length":48,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1763351376,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":403174,"user_name":"想去环游世界的海贼王","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4411711,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"806458